# Frontend build-time variables (set in Vercel > Project > Settings > Environment Variables, or frontend/.env.production.local).
# These are PUBLIC: Vite inlines them into the browser bundle. NEVER put API keys or secrets here.
#
# Backend API base URL including /api (no trailing slash). Leave unset for local dev (Vite proxies /api) and Docker/nginx.
# VITE_API_URL=https://your-api.onrender.com/api
# Optional. Derived from VITE_API_URL when unset (https -> wss, adds /ws).
# VITE_WS_URL=wss://your-api.onrender.com/api/ws
